From https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports/-/work_items/18521:
Reduce Bison's initial parser stack depth to 16. The parser can grow its stack dynamically when necessary. I have confirmed that adding the following patch file into the sources of the APKBUILD resolves the segfault:
---
--- a/modules/amd_parse.y
+++ b/modules/amd_parse.y
@@ -68,3 +68,7 @@
 #define YYDEBUG 0
+/* The default Bison parser stack is too large for musl's default thread
+ * stack. Start smaller and let Bison grow the stack as needed.
+ */
+#define YYINITDEPTH 16

 #ifndef YYENABLE_NLS
